error: an `#[entity]` takes no `#[graphql(...)]` of its own: async-graphql reads the first one on a method and this decorator has to emit `#[graphql(entity)]` there, so yours would silently take its place and the method would stop being an entity resolver. Rename the method itself, or move what you were configuring to the type's own `#[graphql(...)]`
